            296.2746887207031,
            584.526123046875
          ],
          "text": "In an ideal M–S junction, there is a fundamental quantum limit in the \njunction contact resistance by assuming ballistic transport of the con-\nducting modes:"
        }
      ],
      "number": null,
      "quantities": [],
      "epistemic_status": "AUTHOR_CLAIM",
